[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3384946605","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111436#issuecomment-3384946605","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111436","id":3384946605,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Jwi-t","user":{"login":"xuhuisheng","id":1118508,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTg1MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1118508?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng","html_url":"https://github.com/xuhuisheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-09T09:20:18Z","updated_at":"2025-10-09T09:20:18Z","body":"After draw polygons following points, then paint weights, The texture can display. It seems skeleton will use polygons and weight to sync transform or something. Even we don't mention the invisible weight painting, the disappearing behavior is strange.\n\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/012e2db3-4e8d-4fef-a248-4ac392c322cf\" />","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3384946605/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3388224603","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111436#issuecomment-3388224603","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111436","id":3388224603,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7J9DRb","user":{"login":"xuhuisheng","id":1118508,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTg1MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1118508?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng","html_url":"https://github.com/xuhuisheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-10T04:17:04Z","updated_at":"2025-10-10T04:17:04Z","body":"@DiscantX \nI apologize for the misleading information.\nPolygons are unnecessary. The weight is the key.\n\nWhen we bind a skeleton to a polygon and sync the bones, the editor will init all of bones weight for the node, but the default values are all (0, 0, 0, 0), which means any of bones wont affect polygon's shape, then the shape of polygons wont be rendered, disappearing.\n\nWhen we selected one of bones, open Bones tab, paints weights on the polygon, then the polygon can be rendered.\n\nI still feel this operation is strange, but I have no idea to optimize it, yet. There are lots of issues on skeleton editor.\n\n- Default sync leading polygon disappearing, without noticing. \n- Cannot clearly watch which bones affects the current polygon, with weight not zero.\n- Cannot clearly watch the weight on the Bone tab. e.g. In blender, I can see different color on weight view. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3388224603/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]